01-5187-5163",{"_":179,"when":180,"who":181},"Marta Fogagnolo revised the text encoding, added the translation and the commentary","2026-08-03","#martaf",[],[184,185,186],"Kaibel, 1890, IG","Curtius, Kirchhoff, Roehl, 1877, CIG","Agnello, 1953, Silloge di iscrizioni paleocristiane della Sicilia",[188,189,190],"Q2SBPG9F","533T8HNS","D9BZFDDR",[192,193,194,22,26,195,196,197,198,196,199,93],"isic001366","funerary inscription for primigenios",{"_":5},"catina","catania","sicilia","sicily","ancient greek",[],{"title":202,"body":203,"divs":204,"editions":223,"images":233,"handnote":234},"ISic001366. Funerary inscription for Primigenios","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθάδ[ε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"κῖ\n                    τε\">[κῖ-]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>τε\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Πριμ\">Π&lt;ρ?&gt;ιμ\u003C/span>[ιγένιος?]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ὑποδ[ιάκονος] \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κὲ\">κὲ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"θυρ\">θυρ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔ[.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κῖ\n                    τε\">..]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΤΕ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πριμιγένιος\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Πριμ\">ΠΙΜ\u003C/span>[.......]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΥΠΟΔ[.......]\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κὲ\">ΚΕ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"θυρ\">ΘΥΡ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text after IG\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"lines 1-2\">lines.1-2: \u003Cspan>[κεῖ]|τε CIG IV 9501; [κῖ]|τε IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 2\">line.2: \u003Cspan>Πιμ[ιγένιος IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54; ΠΙΜ[ CIG IV 9501\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 4\">line.4: \u003Cspan>θυρ[ CIG IV 9501; θυρ[ωρός IG XIV 547, Agnello 1953 n. 54\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Here lies Primigenios, hypodiakonos and ...\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The Christian funerary inscription records the name of the deceased, \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμιγένιος\u003C/span> (cf. \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμιγένης\u003C/span> in IG XIV 467 = \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001291\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001291\u003C/a> and \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμογένης\u003C/span> in IG XIV 546 = \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001365\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001365\u003C/a>, both from Catania), together with some ranks of the ecclesiastical hierarchy (cf. Grossi Gondi 1920, 120–125, 133–136); on the reading at l. 4 \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">θυρ[ωρός\u003C/span>, see Agnello (1953 n. 54).\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Kirchhoff 1877 9501 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">547\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Agnello 1953 no.54 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Grossi Gondi 1920 120–125, 133–136 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002241\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002241\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  \u003C/div>",[205,208,211,214,217,220],{"id":206,"html":207},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex A